{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, approach it. If grasped, move it to location and check properties. If touching ground, pick up.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrasped    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectTouchingGround    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
    "BT": {
